WEBVTT

00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:34.036
and 130,000 people were displaced
in Zimbabwe and Mozambique.

00:02:34.076 --> 00:02:35.636
I asked myself:

00:02:35.676 --> 00:02:40.516
What crime has my generation
committed to deserve this?

00:02:40.956 --> 00:02:42.716
Then, just two years later,

00:02:42.716 --> 00:02:46.996
Cyclone Idai hit, devastating
the eastern part of my country.

00:02:47.036 --> 00:02:49.276
It claimed over 1,000 lives,

00:02:49.316 --> 00:02:51.796
affecting another
three million in the region.

00:02:52.236 --> 00:02:55.396
Schools and homes were destroyed.

00:02:55.796 --> 00:02:58.996
Over 9,000 students
had their schooling disrupted.

00:02:59.036 --> 00:03:02.356
What wrong have we done to deserve this?